@startuml
title CG03 late arrival, CG05 self check-out and CG04 pause
hide empty description
[*] --> SCHEDULED : manager publishes and assigns
SCHEDULED --> ARRIVED : check-in / authorized + window + plan tasks
ARRIVED --> IN_PROGRESS : same check-in transaction
IN_PROGRESS : PENDING task -> DONE / SKIPPED / REFUSED
IN_PROGRESS : task writes advance parent version, not Visit state
SCHEDULED --> EXCEPTION : incident / start reached
ARRIVED --> EXCEPTION : incident
IN_PROGRESS --> EXCEPTION : incident
SCHEDULED : SYS03 records alert and advances version, no state change
EXCEPTION --> ARRIVED : only proven legacy SYS03 / locked check-in
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : caregiver check-out / server departure time
COMPLETED : pending tasks and evidence remain unchanged
COMPLETED : elder confirmation is a separate subsequent step
EXCEPTION : ordinary execution commands blocked
EXCEPTION : manager resolves Incident, not Visit
state "Terminal Visit (existing)" as Terminal
Terminal : supplemental incident preserves terminal status
note bottom of IN_PROGRESS
All-DONE is not COMPLETED.
Check-out is explicit, not gated on task/evidence completeness.
Evidence upload remains future scope.
end note
@enduml
